   pin rating, as TI rates its OPA165x / OPA166x audio op-amps, is about 1.33 A peak / 0.2 uC). 8 kV: IEC level 4;
   4 kV: the contact level EN 55103-2 asks of professional audio (on accessible metal, not usually connector pins)
